Add username validation: URL/@ parsing + API existence check

- parse_username_input(): supports civitai.com + civitai.red (with www.)
- Rejects any non-Civitai URL (pixiv, twitter, etc.)
- Validates username format before adding
- Calls Civitai API to confirm user exists with public works
- Both /add and /backfill use validation
- All messages in Chinese
